        "tool_name": "final_result",
        "args": "{\"best_index\": 0, \"rationale\": \"The first reply is grounded in both knowledge base chunks: it references the flicker issue and the controller heat warning, advising the customer to cut power and check the plug, which aligns with the KB. It is helpful by addressing safety concerns and offering a warranty resolution (replacement, not just store credit). The tone is empathetic and professional. The second reply is less helpful as it offers store credit without confirming a replacement and fails to mention the safety risk of heat. It also omits the critical instruction to unplug immediately.\", \"scores\": [{\"criterion\": \"grounded\", \"score\": 5}, {\"criterion\": \"helpful\", \"score\": 5}, {\"criterion\": \"tone\", \"score\": 5}]}",
